1. Purpose of This Document
This document is the locked reference for all V1 frontend and UI development of Servio. It must be read at the start of every development session before any screen is built or modified.
It defines the design system, screen inventory, build phases, role-based navigation, and all UI decisions that have been agreed and locked. Nothing in this document may be changed without a formal decision logged in the command board.

2. Design System — Locked
2.1 Colour Palette
Role	Hex	Usage
Primary Green	#0F6E56	Sidebar active, buttons, accents
Dark Green	#042C1E	Top bar, popup headers, text
Mid Green	#1D9E75	Gradients, hover states, avatar
Bright Teal	#3DBFA0	Active dots, confirmed states, logo mark
Light Teal	#C6F0E5	Sidebar active bg, card accent circles
Pale Green	#EBF9F4	User block bg, active nav bg, card bg
Gold	#D4960A	Pending/action-needed card gradient
App Background	#F2F8F5	Main content area background

2.2 Typography
Element	Font	Usage
Display / Headings	Playfair Display	Page greetings, card values, logo name
Body / UI	DM Sans	All UI text, labels, buttons, nav items

2.3 Top Bar
•	Background: #042C1E (dark green)
•	Left: Servio name only in Playfair Display — no sub-text, no credentials, no avatar
•	Centre: Meal status pill — current meal open/closed with animated dot
•	Right: Bell (notifications), Help circle, Logout — white icons, no background box
•	Notification bell shows gold dot when unread notifications exist
•	Logout button turns red on hover

2.4 Left Sidebar
•	Background: white, 0.5px right border
•	Top: user block — initials circle, name, role badge — inside pale green card
•	Nav items: icon + label, active item has left green border indicator and pale green background
•	Section labels: 9px uppercase, muted
•	Badges: gold for action-needed counts, green for informational counts
•	Bottom: Logout link in muted colour, turns red on hover

2.5 Main Content Area
•	Background: #F2F8F5
•	Header: greeting in Playfair Display italic, date/tenant sub-text, role pill (dark green)
•	Stat cards: 3 per row — white card, dark green gradient card, gold gradient card
•	Order CTA: employees only — white card with Order Now button in primary green
•	Two-column section: Today Menu + Recent Activity

2.6 Bottom Strip
Three lines, centre-aligned, dark green background:
•	Line 1: Tagline in Playfair Display italic — Every meal, every service, every event; perfectly managed.
•	Line 2: Developed by HomiLabs · homilabs.org
•	Line 3: Managed by Awaiz Fatima · Muhammad Abdulhadi · Parishay Zainab
•	Right side: support icon — opens popup with manager contact number and tenant support email from appSettings

2.7 Notification Popup
•	Drops from bell icon, right-aligned
•	Dark green header with notification count and Mark all read
•	Each notification: icon (green or gold tinted square), message, timestamp
•	Footer: Servio v1.0 · FFL Management Club only — no developer contact
•	Dismisses on outside click

